description = "The Mace, The Crusher, The Morningstar. Crush your foes and leave them broken so they can never hurt you. Face them head on and give them no quarter, for that is the only way to be safe.[br][br]“The Mace is a weapon for fools and imbeciles. Swinging around a big hunk of metal will never get anyone anywhere.” - King Gregor III, shortly before getting his head smashed in."
